  - Prepare a checklist of documents to give to a CPA or to use in tax software.
  - Show a side‑by‑side (itemize vs standard) if you have any other deductible items to include.

Would you like me to run the more precise numbers? If so, please confirm:
1) The $1,350 are business expenses related to your 2 consulting clients (yes/no).
2) The $2,700 student‑loan interest number — is that interest paid during 2023 (and was any of it reported on a 1098‑E)?
3) Any other deductible items (mortgage interest, property taxes, state income tax paid, large medical expenses)?

