- Proof for charitable gift (receipt for $800)
- 1098‑E from MOHELA showing student loan interest paid in 2023
- Rent statements/ledger and utility bills if using the regular home‑office method (to support your allocable portion)
- Records of state tax withheld (from W‑2) and any state estimated payments for SALT calculation if you were to itemize

5) Action items / questions for you
