- Is the $2,700 the amount of student loan interest you paid in 2023? (Only interest paid in 2023 can be claimed on the 2023 return. You should have a 1098‑E for 2023 if you paid interest last year.)
- Did you receive any 1099‑NEC or 1099‑MISC for your consulting clients? Did either client withhold or issue forms?
- How much state tax (Arizona) was withheld from your paycheck in 2023, or did you make state estimated payments? (This matters for the SALT deduction if you were thinking about itemizing.)

